-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
18. BEST PRACTICES FOR USERS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Always log in via `/login.html` before accessing protected pages.
- Prefer `/app.html` for navigation to keep a consistent experience.
- When using Business Setup:
  - Start with Company Profile (address, employees, product lines).
  - Then configure Warehouses, Spaces, Assets, Certifications, and Unions.
- For HR:
  - Use HR Index to create employee master data.
  - Maintain payroll Totals for statutory and reporting purposes.
- For Safety:
  - Use Safety Audits to plan audits, capture issues, then raise RFQs.
  - Use Safety Training to record sessions and demonstrate training records.
- For Accounting:
  - Use Banks and Petty Cash first to ensure financial base is set.
  - Add Payables/Receivables as your vendor/customer flows require.
- For Support/Billing:
  - Support tickets capture issues.
  - Billing handles subscription for each tenant.

This manual can be shared as a reference for new users of the ComplytEX
(SaaS Agent) application.
